ui.utilitycraft:info.compactor=Its 3x3 input and 3x3 output buffers compact matching material stacks into denser forms. The configuration covers vanilla materials, every compressed-block tier, and the item containers shipped by this pack. It accepts Speed, Energy, Hyper Processing, and Stack upgrades. Costs start at 800 DE for nugget-to-ingot and multiply by nine for each successive compression level.\n\nItem I/O:\n§9Input§r exposes all nine material slots.\n§cOutput§r exposes all nine compressed-result slots.
ui.utilitycraft:io.compactor.items=I/O Modes:\n§r- §9Input 3x3\n§r- §cOutput 3x3
