ui.utilitycraft:info.decompactor=Reverses only recipes registered by the Compactor. One dense unit returns the exact previous material amount, including compressed blocks, bags, bundles, jars, and other registered containers. Its 3x3 buffers process and distribute batches without losing items. The machine stops before consuming input whenever the output lacks enough room. It accepts Speed, Energy, Hyper Processing, and Stack upgrades.\n\nItem I/O:\n§9Input§r exposes all nine dense-material slots.\n§cOutput§r exposes all nine recovered-material slots.
ui.utilitycraft:io.decompactor.items=I/O Modes:\n§r- §9Input 3x3\n§r- §cOutput 3x3
