ui.ascendant:alchemy.guide.common=Regular potion\nDuration: 0:15 - 3:00\nGeneral duration range.\nDepends on the effect.\nInstant effects have no duration.
ui.ascendant:alchemy.guide.splash=Splash potion\nDuration: 0:15 - 3:00\nRegular potion + Gunpowder.\nKeeps its level and duration.
ui.ascendant:alchemy.guide.lingering=Lingering potion\nDuration: 0:03 - 0:45\nSplash potion + Dragon's Breath.\nEach cloud effect lasts 1/4\nof the drinkable duration.
ui.ascendant:alchemy.guide.amplified_1=Amplified potion (+1)\nDuration: 0:15 - 3:00\nI -> II, where supported.\nAmplify once; keeps duration.
ui.ascendant:alchemy.guide.amplified_2=Amplified potion (+2)\nDuration: 0:15 - 3:00\nI -> II -> III, where supported.\nAmplify twice from level I.\nKeeps duration.
ui.ascendant:alchemy.guide.extended=Extended potion (+1)\nDuration: 0:40 - 8:00\nLevel I + Redstone, or\nuse Extend with Aetherium.\nKeeps the potion's level.
ui.ascendant:alchemy.guide.maximum=Maximum potion\nDuration: 2:40 - 32:00\nMaximum level depends on effect.\nAmplify to its limit, then\nExtend twice from normal.\nInstant effects cannot be extended.
